{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">伯恩斯坦：腾讯二季度资本开支与预付款合计超千亿</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">腾讯<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>财报最值得关注的数字，不是收入，也不是广告增速，而是资本开支。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>在最新报告里点明，当季资本开支<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">528亿元</span>人民币，加上<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">514亿元</span>的预付款，合计超过千亿。这个体量，比一季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">319亿元</span>的资本开支高出约六成，也远超<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>全年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">792亿元</span>的水平。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">市场对腾讯加大AI投入早有预期，但数字出来还是让人停了一下。更值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的是，管理层把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>形容为资本开支的“一次性集中投入”，后续是否继续加码，要看AI投入的回报表现。这句话放在财报电话会里，听起来像是对未来两年折旧不确定性提前打预防针。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXItfT3hJXa1O2icmHy6yShP1fJDnPPs4T0a7FTzzqPibFl0lpPjePv1sEoS0Gw35XT611bdxSoN9iafQ16zXoknsO68noXykEUjk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入与利润基本符合预期，游戏和广告是主要拉动</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看基本面。腾讯<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2048亿元</span>人民币，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>，与<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>预期持平，比市场一致预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>。毛利<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1184亿元</span>，增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.8%</span>。非GAAP经营利润756亿元，同比增长9.2%，基本符合预期。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">分业务看，游戏收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">659亿元</span>，增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11.4%</span>。国内游戏增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17%</span>，国际游戏按固定汇率计算增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>。管理层特别提到Valorant和Delta Force在PC端的表现。广告收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">436亿元</span>，增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">21.8%</span>，比一季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19.8%</span>的增速进一步加快，也超出市场预期约3%。资金科技与企业服务收入603亿元，增长8.6%，与预期一致。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUn90wyTHKCGKU0ZNWPW2nwZpH5x1FhxfQ0Y77KHT4oKWQNumZTu9xZWWHIVrC4pgFNw13JDgc9czgZJPLbj7Of6rDZarEA1KE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里有一个细节值得留意。Miniclip旗下新游戏Arrow's Puzzle Escape的收入被计入了营销服务而非游戏，如果剔除这部分，国际游戏增速会快4个百分点，广告增速则回落到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>左右。管理层提醒不要把这游戏的贡献外推到未来几个季度，但<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>认为，随着游戏内广告变现模式普及，这类跨业务线的收入归类以后还会出现。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看Arrow's Puzzle Escape这笔收入归类，它让广告增速看起来比实际经营动能更高。简单说，游戏内广告变现越普遍，收入归类的口径就越影响我们对单一业务线的判断；后续更值得看的是腾讯会不会给出更细的披露口径。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWXsmlEB75bpqZUchhibRDyNrR6yUL2GYR4omPFehnevvOw85zTBbHqX3oHnqe2A8DRAY8xXmfrFZqGQtNiaNp1rhrC8b5td7bwI/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 资本开支集中投入，经营杠杆要等到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>之后</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>资本开支<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">528亿元</span>，加上<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">514亿元</span>预付款，这个数字是财报里最核心的信息。预付款的作用是锁定<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>的硬件价格，也就是说，腾讯不仅采购算力，还在为未来交付提前占产能。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVfbRtdprIJNiaq0wF02ea4FoI8CK6tTprKYNJlOLlbgW5NlXvibdE42h9KkQ8L3Qic6wnRiaWQH9aXJIXibAiaomqbibnB1BSdN224Wc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 10-Bernstein-Tencent Holdings Ltd-0700.HK-Tencent Q2- Answering the capex question-260813</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
